      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a fat and muscular hairy man.",
      "chapters": [
        1049
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He laughs and says he brought many yellow haired slaves, including quasi-masters in refinement path. He raises his hands for quiet, then brings out the first slave. When Fang Zheng is thrown onto the stage nearly fainting, Kang Ba scolds the handler, then changes from angry to joyous and points at Fang Zheng as a rare breed obtained with great difficulty. The audience notices Fang Zheng’s faint Gu Master aura and rank five cultivation level.",
